## 📝 Generated Files Protocol

**CRITICAL**: Always include generated files (e.g., `*.g.dart`, `*.config.dart`, `*.freezed.dart`) in your context. 
- **DO NOT** ignore them even if they are in `.gitignore`.
- **MANDATORY**: Read `injection.config.dart` to understand the current DI container whenever analyzing dependencies or injection logic.

---

## Essential Commands

```bash
# Code generation (after any model/theme/locale changes)
melos genAlls

# Format code
dart format lib/

# Analyze (MUST have 0 issues before submitting)
fvm flutter analyze --no-fatal-infos
```

